WEBVTT

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:08.110
Ellen!

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:16.120
I knew that Nemo's death would herald
the collapse of the world.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.620
So I arranged to wind time back 
a bit when he met his end.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:27.560
You mean back at Burgot Volcano...

00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:32.950
I'm sorry I didn't tell you the truth.

00:00:32.950 --> 00:00:34.000
Ellen!

00:00:34.830 --> 00:00:36.110
It's all right.

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:43.270
I'm finally able to witness a future 
I've never seen before.

00:00:45.050 --> 00:00:48.440
I find that terribly exciting.

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:55.560
Thank you, Ellen.

00:01:01.130 --> 00:01:05.040
I'll use my life to protect everyone.

00:01:22.890 --> 00:01:28.900
All you've achieved 
is a brief stay of execution.

00:01:29.360 --> 00:01:32.760
The vortex of destruction is right here.

00:01:33.180 --> 00:01:35.190
It's inside me.

00:01:35.610 --> 00:01:38.870
I won't let it be sealed away ever again.

00:01:38.870 --> 00:01:42.250
Now, I shall fully embrace...

00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:44.400
the end of the world!

00:03:19.520 --> 00:03:21.360
Hey! Hey!

00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:22.830
Hey, Jou!

00:03:24.810 --> 00:03:26.110
Gildan...

00:03:27.160 --> 00:03:31.310
<b>Finale\h\h\h-Nemo-</b>

00:03:27.820 --> 00:03:31.310
I see. Miss Sophitia was...

00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:35.630
It's not your fault. Don't let it bother you.

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:12.480
The world is small... so very small...

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:14.100
What...

00:04:14.330 --> 00:04:16.650
What in the world is happening?

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:20.250
We fought.

00:04:20.250 --> 00:04:22.490
We lost so much.

00:04:23.230 --> 00:04:26.870
But the world never changed.

00:04:36.550 --> 00:04:37.880
Wh-What...

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:47.130
Yes...

00:04:47.130 --> 00:04:52.980
This time, I shall save everyone!

00:04:58.740 --> 00:05:00.860
You sure you can handle this?

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:03.360
We've gotta stop her, don't we?!

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:20.630
Is everyone all right?!

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:22.000
President Faria!

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:23.450
I'll explain later!

00:05:26.230 --> 00:05:28.870
Everyone, follow your class 
representatives and form ranks!

00:05:28.870 --> 00:05:29.930
Roger!

00:05:35.130 --> 00:05:36.280
Damn!

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:40.810
What should I do?

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:44.230
<i>Steady your heart, Nemo.</i>

00:05:44.700 --> 00:05:45.990
Genius?

00:05:46.350 --> 00:05:49.000
<i>She's merged with the vortex of destruction.</i>

00:05:49.420 --> 00:05:53.110
<i>A Legis Breaker at close range
 will seal it away.</i>

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:01.790
What's going on?!

00:06:02.220 --> 00:06:03.300
Reda!

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:05.890
Is there something you can do?

00:06:05.890 --> 00:06:07.550
Genius says there is!

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:08.470
Then go!

00:06:09.370 --> 00:06:11.430
You have us to fight behind you!

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:13.230
"Us"?

00:06:13.230 --> 00:06:14.680
She means <i>us!</i>

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:21.020
Sorry for the wait!

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:22.190
Sorry about everything.

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:23.820
Jou! And Gildan!

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:26.690
Drop the friendship act 
and get going already!

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:28.910
You're the one who started it.

00:06:28.910 --> 00:06:29.820
Shut up!

00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:32.570
Thanks, everyone!

00:06:42.430 --> 00:06:45.450
You don't plan to lie there and die, do you?

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:49.470
Ah... was I that obvious?

00:06:49.850 --> 00:06:53.340
You can fool the president, 
but you can't fool me.

00:06:53.980 --> 00:06:56.150
Time control is major magic.

00:06:56.150 --> 00:06:57.870
It must take a toll.

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:01.560
I just go with the flow, you know...

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:03.980
Please, Ellen...

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:08.040
Do my feelings mean nothing to you?

00:07:10.780 --> 00:07:14.990
I can't live without you.

00:07:15.690 --> 00:07:20.500
Can you justify leaving me all on my own?

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:24.620
You can't, can you?

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:26.000
In that case...

00:07:29.820 --> 00:07:34.500
You can drink my blood and share 
eternity with me as a vampire.

00:07:35.400 --> 00:07:36.620
Shirley?

00:07:38.010 --> 00:07:39.510
Live, Ellen.

00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:41.400
For my sake.

00:07:49.090 --> 00:07:51.690
I failed to account for this...

00:07:53.090 --> 00:07:56.220
But I suppose it's just as well.

00:07:57.030 --> 00:07:58.650
Nemo taught me...

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:02.610
that when you want something, 
you have to wish for it...

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:05.520
and seize it for yourself!

00:08:13.410 --> 00:08:16.050
This dark power has us walled off.

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:17.800
Then we can't get any closer.

00:08:20.320 --> 00:08:24.770
Nemo, you're the only one who can 
seal the vortex of destruction.

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:25.560
Faria?

00:08:26.010 --> 00:08:30.320
At this rate, everything will be
 sucked into the darkness.

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:35.340
Before that happens, I'll use all 
 of my power to forge the way!

00:08:35.790 --> 00:08:37.260
There's no time to waste!

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:39.700
But if you do that...

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:41.350
Spare yourself the trouble.

00:08:46.140 --> 00:08:47.210
Gareth?!

00:08:58.720 --> 00:08:59.780
Don't do this!

00:08:59.780 --> 00:09:01.390
You won't survive it!

00:09:01.390 --> 00:09:02.140
Forget about me!

00:09:03.150 --> 00:09:05.510
This is my atonement.

00:09:05.510 --> 00:09:11.100
Besides... I'm the only member of the 
Seven Knights with the power of darkness!

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:12.860
Gareth...

00:09:13.380 --> 00:09:16.010
Dark Ruler Chris...

00:09:16.660 --> 00:09:19.480
Turn my rage into power!

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:23.360
<i>I acknowledge your anger!</i>

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:31.630
I can't afford to die... until I make amends.

00:09:31.980 --> 00:09:35.630
I could never face Claire otherwise.

00:09:39.970 --> 00:09:41.350
Go!

00:09:42.440 --> 00:09:43.430
Thank you!

00:09:44.090 --> 00:09:45.000
Let's go!

00:09:49.160 --> 00:09:51.620
The rest is... up to you.

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:07.660
Sophitia!

00:10:07.980 --> 00:10:09.150
Stop this!

00:10:09.150 --> 00:10:10.460
You won't be able to control the world!

00:10:10.460 --> 00:10:12.140
You're just going to destroy it!

00:10:12.950 --> 00:10:15.460
I never wanted to control it.

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:17.670
That would be wicked!

00:10:18.020 --> 00:10:20.070
Then what <i>do</i> you want?!

00:10:20.730 --> 00:10:24.750
As long as people live, they harm one another

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:27.310
and bring each other sorrow.

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:30.190
You're saying that's our sin?

00:10:30.760 --> 00:10:32.040
Certainly not!

00:10:32.040 --> 00:10:35.440
We're <i>all</i> sinners, Nemo.

00:10:35.840 --> 00:10:40.780
Didn't I tell you? 
You could be a beacon of hope...

00:10:42.010 --> 00:10:47.690
I can't tell you how happy I was 
when you came to this school.

00:10:47.690 --> 00:10:52.160
With my beloved Genius's 
soul inside you, no less...

00:10:52.160 --> 00:10:54.670
You loved Genius?

00:10:56.140 --> 00:10:58.980
If everyone's capable of 
hurting everyone else,

00:10:58.980 --> 00:11:02.060
we must all be punished equally.

00:11:02.060 --> 00:11:06.060
That's the path to true happiness.

00:11:06.340 --> 00:11:07.430
You...

00:11:07.810 --> 00:11:10.510
I wish I'd planted a seed within you

00:11:10.510 --> 00:11:14.050
to make the Legis Breaker go berserk...

00:11:14.050 --> 00:11:15.180
Possession?

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:18.940
But the Legis Breaker <i>did</i> go berserk.

00:11:19.470 --> 00:11:21.950
Which means we're...

00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:25.540
You're the true Seven Knights!

00:11:25.540 --> 00:11:29.100
Yes, the heroes who will save everyone!

00:11:29.100 --> 00:11:29.960
You're wrong!

00:11:29.960 --> 00:11:33.460
What you're doing is just murder!

00:11:34.220 --> 00:11:37.460
No matter how wrong our actions may be,
 we can always try again!

00:11:38.430 --> 00:11:39.500
<i>That's right.</i>

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:42.220
<i>We may very well all be sinners.</i>

00:11:42.440 --> 00:11:47.190
<i>But we have young people who can 
transcend our foolish mistakes!</i>

00:11:49.830 --> 00:11:51.690
<i>That's why heroes fight!</i>

00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:54.690
<i>With blazing feelings in our hearts!</i>

00:11:58.670 --> 00:12:00.940
<i>We are not alone!</i>

00:12:00.940 --> 00:12:03.200
<i>We have friends to cover our backs!</i>

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:05.340
<i>Even if we were born in different ages,</i>

00:12:05.340 --> 00:12:08.320
<i>our successors are our comrades!</i>

00:12:09.130 --> 00:12:12.960
<i>Even if our bodies fall, our souls live on!</i>

00:12:13.310 --> 00:12:14.620
<i>As long as someone succeeds it,</i>

00:12:14.620 --> 00:12:16.210
<i>our will remains eternal!</i>

00:12:18.480 --> 00:12:19.420
<i>Indeed!</i>

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:21.210
<i>The flame of the heart 
cannot be extinguished!</i>

00:12:21.710 --> 00:12:25.720
<i>No matter how stained by sin 
and sorrow it may be...</i>

00:12:26.080 --> 00:12:28.700
<i>As long as we believe in our friends,</i>

00:12:28.700 --> 00:12:31.480
<i>even the cruelest of 
destinies can be changed!</i>

00:12:31.870 --> 00:12:33.000
No...

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:35.390
You reject my salvation again?!

00:12:35.390 --> 00:12:36.780
Genius!

00:12:37.670 --> 00:12:39.020
What you're describing...

00:12:41.370 --> 00:12:43.780
...is <i>not</i> salvation!

00:12:59.070 --> 00:13:01.260
That's the Eunomia I remember.

00:13:06.190 --> 00:13:07.350
She disappeared?

00:13:07.350 --> 00:13:08.010
But where?!

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:26.550
Faria!

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:01.070
Faria!

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:15.660
I'll seal you for good this time!

00:14:18.680 --> 00:14:20.050
Use my power, too!

00:14:20.770 --> 00:14:24.250
Legis Breaker!

00:14:30.270 --> 00:14:32.140
Nemo! President!

00:14:32.140 --> 00:14:33.510
Look at them!

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:35.180
Keep it up!

00:14:36.130 --> 00:14:37.280
That light...

00:14:42.090 --> 00:14:43.190
It's being infused.

00:14:43.540 --> 00:14:46.960
The purging light of Legis Breaker!

00:14:46.960 --> 00:14:49.950
You can do it, Nemo! President!

00:15:16.350 --> 00:15:18.680
You truly are the Son of Destruction.

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:21.440
Don't call me that...

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:30.860
Not yet...

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:34.620
Well, I do believe you've reached 
the limits of what you can do.

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:38.380
So goodnight to both of you!

00:15:43.090 --> 00:15:45.600
The hour of salvation is upon us.

00:15:45.600 --> 00:15:46.960
You're out of time.

00:15:47.600 --> 00:15:51.260
This is the end of your pointless struggling.

00:15:51.950 --> 00:15:56.260
Lie down and accept your salvation!

00:16:00.960 --> 00:16:04.270
You can no longer stop me!

00:16:06.240 --> 00:16:07.920
Maybe so.

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:14.540
Yet... I still have power within me!

00:16:15.770 --> 00:16:19.330
The power you gave me, Sophitia.

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:22.290
Nemo, what are you doing?

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:24.330
Sorry, Faria.

00:16:24.740 --> 00:16:27.170
I've been lying to you all this time.

00:16:29.810 --> 00:16:32.510
I couldn't become anyone.

00:16:33.370 --> 00:16:34.890
I'm not human...

00:16:35.520 --> 00:16:37.920
And I couldn't become a 
proper monster, either.

00:16:39.760 --> 00:16:42.970
I wasn't worthy of being one of you.

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:48.580
But... since you said you'd protect me...

00:16:49.170 --> 00:16:51.820
Since you called me your friend...

00:16:52.540 --> 00:16:56.140
I think I managed to become <i>something</i>.

00:16:58.310 --> 00:16:59.220
Nemo!

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:05.820
Thank you, Faria.

00:17:12.100 --> 00:17:13.180
I'll be back.

00:17:25.700 --> 00:17:26.870
What in the world?

00:17:27.950 --> 00:17:28.940
That's...

00:17:28.940 --> 00:17:32.070
It's a monster, but it's merged with a hero?

00:17:33.470 --> 00:17:36.990
Why won't you accept your sin?!

00:17:36.990 --> 00:17:38.440
I have!

00:17:38.440 --> 00:17:40.990
The real Nemo died because of me!

00:17:40.990 --> 00:17:42.620
It's more than just that!

00:17:43.120 --> 00:17:47.440
You devoured him!
Stole his memories and form!

00:17:48.890 --> 00:17:50.180
Yes...

00:17:50.180 --> 00:17:52.690
He told me to live!

00:17:56.740 --> 00:17:58.340
You're almost there.

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:00.890
Why...?

00:18:01.610 --> 00:18:05.020
You seem to be suffering.

00:18:05.460 --> 00:18:08.360
What does that matter?

00:18:08.890 --> 00:18:14.090
If someone's suffering... 
you're supposed to help them!

00:18:20.180 --> 00:18:23.380
You deserve to live.

00:18:25.570 --> 00:18:28.910
I still don't understand why he did that.

00:18:28.910 --> 00:18:32.540
But... I have to live!

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:35.800
What a self-serving reason!

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:38.490
Sinners deserve death!

00:18:38.490 --> 00:18:40.390
You do! And so do I!

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:42.890
It's the only way to achieve salvation!

00:18:43.960 --> 00:18:48.310
Punishment, salvation... 
I can't receive either!

00:18:48.750 --> 00:18:52.810
Living in this world is all I can do!

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:12.260
Your sorrow...

00:19:14.990 --> 00:19:19.090
<i>I'll purge it from the world this time.</i>

00:19:19.710 --> 00:19:22.520
You're going to use the seal again?

00:19:23.020 --> 00:19:27.850
If you do... you'll lose all your power.

00:19:28.460 --> 00:19:31.430
You'll become a powerless human.

00:19:31.430 --> 00:19:33.100
The power of salvation...

00:19:33.100 --> 00:19:37.110
I never needed it.

00:19:37.870 --> 00:19:39.890
Why, darling?

00:19:39.890 --> 00:19:42.840
Why do you never listen to me?

00:19:43.690 --> 00:19:45.130
Genius...

00:19:45.630 --> 00:19:49.810
You're going to disappear for good, too...

00:19:50.780 --> 00:19:54.320
<i>Nemo. Forge thy heart's desire.</i>

00:19:55.930 --> 00:19:57.620
My heart's desire...

00:20:00.210 --> 00:20:01.890
I want a future for all of us!

00:20:48.120 --> 00:20:49.930
Lookin' good, Reda!

00:20:51.210 --> 00:20:52.810
Sh-Shut up!

00:20:56.270 --> 00:21:00.320
Long ago, there was a girl 
who wanted to be my friend.

00:21:01.660 --> 00:21:07.820
But I knew she was going to die, 
so I turned her away.

00:21:08.730 --> 00:21:12.320
Still, I wish I had befriended her.

00:21:17.100 --> 00:21:19.760
We'll be together forever.

00:21:22.750 --> 00:21:23.390
Yes.

00:21:29.060 --> 00:21:30.330
I'll get stronger.

00:21:30.800 --> 00:21:35.730
I'll get even stronger and protect 
the world in Nemo's place!

00:21:35.730 --> 00:21:37.110
Just you watch!

00:21:43.790 --> 00:21:45.740
Welcome back, Gareth.

00:21:47.340 --> 00:21:50.450
I'm sorry. I've behaved shamefully.

00:21:50.450 --> 00:21:53.730
Worry not. We all made mistakes.

00:21:53.730 --> 00:21:56.200
Yeah, we're all in the same boat.

00:21:58.380 --> 00:21:59.630
Thank you.

00:21:59.980 --> 00:22:02.170
Hey, are you crying?!

00:22:02.170 --> 00:22:03.760
Is he really?!

00:22:03.760 --> 00:22:05.180
Shut up!

00:22:06.170 --> 00:22:07.500
Hey, lemme see! Lemme see!

00:22:07.500 --> 00:22:08.510
I'm not crying!

00:22:27.740 --> 00:22:29.020
Are you sure about this?

00:22:29.470 --> 00:22:31.890
I'm not a successor anymore.

00:22:34.060 --> 00:22:38.040
The power of destruction is 
sealed in the Book of Time.

00:22:38.350 --> 00:22:44.050
Our journey won't end until we find 
a way to eliminate it for good.

00:22:45.190 --> 00:22:46.200
Faria...

00:22:47.300 --> 00:22:51.300
But there's something even 
more important at play.

00:22:52.160 --> 00:22:54.270
I want to be with you.

00:22:54.270 --> 00:22:56.010
I want to protect you forever.

00:22:56.700 --> 00:22:58.940
I want you to protect me forever too...

00:23:01.140 --> 00:23:02.690
Is that not okay?

00:23:09.930 --> 00:23:12.260
No, it makes me happy.

00:23:25.830 --> 00:23:26.630
Let's go.

00:23:30.150 --> 00:23:33.640
<i>Because that's my heart's desire.</i>
